step Rough Sharpening Stone to 35
  tip Rough Sharpening Stone is orange at 1 (yellow 15, green 35, grey 55): about 42 crafts to 35, up to 47 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 1 Rough Stone. One Rough Stone a craft, a point every craft to 15.
  craft 2660 until 35

step Blacksmithing recipes at 35
  tip Back to a Blacksmithing trainer: Rough Grinding Stone (from 25, 1s). Also learn Sharpening Wheel (1s): Forever's Blacksmithing camp item, 1 Rough Stone and 1 Copper Bar, placed at a campsite beside a campfire for its buff. The Camping 101: Blacksmithing quest from your starting area's camping guide (after The Great Outdoors) sends you to a blacksmithing trainer who teaches it free.
  learn 3320
  learn 1230171

step Rough Grinding Stone to 75
  tip Rough Grinding Stone is orange at 35 (yellow 45, green 65, grey 85): about 64 crafts to 75, up to 74 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 2 Rough Stone. Two Rough Stone a craft. Grinding stones are parts for later plans; the extras sell to vendors.
  craft 3320 until 75
  skill Blacksmithing 75

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Journeyman (75-150)
section Blacksmithing 75-150

step Journeyman Blacksmithing
  tip Journeyman raises the cap from 75 to 150 for 5s; it needs Blacksmithing 50 and character level 10, so you can take it on any visit from 50. Not every Blacksmithing trainer teaches it: Alliance Clarise Gnarltree (Duskwood), Daeann Steelwind (Zephras Isle), Rotgath Stonebeard (Ironforge) and Therum Deepforge (Stormwind City); Horde Angus Hammerhand (Tirisfal Glades), Daeann Steelwind (Zephras Isle), James Van Brunt (Undercity), Karn Stonehoof (Thunder Bluff), Snarl (Orgrimmar) and Traugh (The Barrens). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: Runed Copper Belt (from 45, 2s) and Coarse Grinding Stone (from 50, 2s 50c). 75-150 takes about 12s of recipes and 5g 18c of vendor goods, plus 25 Medium Leather, 100 Coarse Stone, 320 Copper Bar and 325 Bronze Bar to gather or buy.
  level 10
  train Blacksmithing Journeyman
  learn 2666
  learn 3326

step Blacksmithing 75-150: vendor goods
  tip Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 25 Strong Flux (5g) and Blacksmith Hammer (a tool: one, kept in your bags, 18c); about 5g 18c in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction (Stormwind City: Billibub Cogspinner, Edna Mullby and Kaita Deepforge; Orgrimmar: Felika, Shimra and Sovik).
  buy 3466 x25 nearest
  buy 5956 nearest -- a tool, keep it in your bags

