  tip 325 Bronze Bar for Blacksmithing 75-150: 25 Patterned Bronze Bracers and 25 Bronze Warhammers. Mining: smelt Copper Bar and Tin Bar. Or buy them at the Auction House.
  collect 2841 x325 anywhere gather Mining 65
