step Runed Copper Belt to 100
  tip Runed Copper Belt is orange at 75 (yellow 85, green 105, grey 125): about 29 crafts to 100, up to 32 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 10 Copper Bar. Forever teaches Runed Copper Belt from 45; it stays orange to 85. Ten Copper Bars a craft: smelt your Copper Ore. Needs an anvil nearby. Blacksmith Hammer is a tool: keep it in your bags.
  craft 2666 until 100

step Blacksmithing recipes at 100
  tip Back to a Blacksmithing trainer: Patterned Bronze Bracers (from 95, 5s) and Bronze Warhammer (from 100, 2s 50c).
  learn 2672
  learn 9985

step Patterned Bronze Bracers to 125
  tip Patterned Bronze Bracers is orange at 100 (yellow 125, green 140, grey 155): about 25 crafts to 125, a point every craft. Each takes 5 Bronze Bar and 2 Coarse Grinding Stone. Make the 50 Coarse Grinding Stone first. Each bracer takes two Coarse Grinding Stones (Coarse Stone from Tin Veins): make them first; they give points too. Needs an anvil nearby.
  craft 3326 x50
  craft 2672 until 125

step Bronze Warhammer to 150
  tip Bronze Warhammer is orange at 125 (yellow 155, green 170, grey 185): about 25 crafts to 150, a point every craft. Each takes 8 Bronze Bar, 1 Strong Flux and 1 Medium Leather. Eight Bronze Bars, a Strong Flux (blacksmithing suppliers) and a Medium Leather a craft; every Journeyman trainer in the capitals teaches it from 100. Needs an anvil nearby. Blacksmithing 150 is a Legacy System milestone.
  craft 9985 until 150
  skill Blacksmithing 150

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Expert (150-225)
section Blacksmithing 150-225

step Expert Blacksmithing
  tip Expert raises the cap from 150 to 225 for 50s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs Blacksmithing 125 and character level 20, so you can take it on any visit from 125. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance Bengus Deepforge (Ironforge); Horde Saru Steelfury (Orgrimmar). This route trains it at Bengus Deepforge (Ironforge) for the Alliance and Saru Steelfury (Orgrimmar) for the Horde, who also teach the recipes of 150-225: one trainer for every visit. Learn now: Green Iron Bracers (from 140) and Heavy Grinding Stone (from 100, 10s). 150-225 takes about 10s of recipes and 28s of vendor goods, plus 60 Heavy Stone, 186 Iron Bar, 302 Steel Bar, 230 Mithril Bar, 84 Thick Leather, 60 Mageweave Cloth and 72 Solid Stone to gather or buy.
  level 20
  train Blacksmithing Expert npc 4258 only Alliance
  train Blacksmithing Expert npc 3355 only Horde
  learn 3501 npc 4258 only Alliance
  learn 3501 npc 3355 only Horde
  learn 3337 npc 4258 only Alliance
  learn 3337 npc 3355 only Horde

step Blacksmithing 150-225: vendor goods
  tip Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 28 Green Dye (28s); about 28s in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction (Stormwind City: Alexandra Bolero, Edna Mullby and Jillian Tanner; Orgrimmar: Borya, Felika and Shimra). If you smelt the 302 Steel Bar yourself (Mining 165: an Iron Bar and a Coal each), buy 302 Coal too (15g 10s, trade and blacksmithing suppliers); skip them if you buy the bars.
  buy 2605 x28 nearest
  buy 3857 x302 nearest optional

