step Get Mageweave Cloth
  tip 60 Mageweave Cloth for Blacksmithing 150-225: 15 Heavy Mithril Gauntlets. Humanoids of level 35-50 drop it, and what you loot as you level counts. The arrow takes you to the best farm for your level: mobs at or below it first, then the most Mageweave Cloth per minute and the nearest; it picks again as you level. The guide window shows the kills and minutes it takes there and a second choice. Or buy them at the Auction House.
  collect 4338 x60 nearest gather levels 35-50
  auction 4338 x60

