step Dense Weightstone to 235
  tip Dense Weightstone is orange at 225 (yellow 230, green 232, grey 235): about 17 crafts to 235, up to 24 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 1 Dense Stone. The trainer teaches it, and it is the cheapest way through these points in the data.
  craft 16640 until 235

step Heavy Mithril Boots to 240
  tip Heavy Mithril Boots is yellow at 235 (yellow 230, green 240, grey 250): about 8 crafts to 240, up to 11 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 14 Mithril Bar and 4 Thick Leather. Mithril Bars from Mithril Deposits; Thick Leather from skinners or the Auction House. Needs an anvil nearby. If you got here without learning Heavy Mithril Boots, learn it now: an earlier step teaches it.
  learn 9968 npc 2836 only Alliance
  learn 9968 npc 2836 only Horde
  craft 9968 until 240

step Plans: Imperial Plate Belt and Plans: Imperial Plate Bracers
  zone Tanaris
  tip Derotain Mudsipper (Tanaris) trades Plans: Imperial Plate Belt (Blacksmithing 240) for 20 Thorium Bar in Imperial Plate Belt and Plans: Imperial Plate Bracers (Blacksmithing 245) for 20 Thorium Bar in Imperial Plate Bracer, which need Blacksmithing 240 and character level 50; take A Blue Light Bargain first (it asks for nothing). The plans bind when picked up. Take the Plans: Imperial Plate Bracers now too: they wait in your bags until 245 for Imperial Plate Bracers, and it saves a trip back.
  level 50
  accept 7652
  turnin 7652
  accept 7653
  turnin 7653
  accept 7655
  turnin 7655

step Imperial Plate Belt to 245
  zone Azeroth
  tip Imperial Plate Belt is orange at 240 (yellow 260, green 270, grey 280): about 5 crafts to 245, a point every craft. Each takes 22 Thorium Bar, 6 Rugged Leather and 1 Aquamarine. Twenty-two Thorium Bars, six Rugged Leather and an Aquamarine a craft, orange from 240: five points, until the bracers plans can be learned at 245. Needs an anvil nearby.
  learn 16647 -- from the recipe in your bags
  craft 16647 until 245

step Imperial Plate Bracers to 265
  tip Imperial Plate Bracers is orange at 245 (yellow 265, green 275, grey 285): about 20 crafts to 265, a point every craft. Each takes 20 Thorium Bar and 1 Star Ruby. Twenty Thorium Bars and a Star Ruby a craft, orange to 265: the fewest Thorium Bars a point Derotain's plans give. Needs an anvil nearby.
  learn 16649 -- from the recipe in your bags
  craft 16649 until 265

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Artisan, with Radiant plans (265-300)
section Blacksmithing 265-300

step Blacksmithing 265: Plans: Radiant Boots
  tip From 265 the route has two ways. Plans: Radiant Boots and Plans: Radiant Leggings drop from mobs all over the world and do not bind, so the Auction House often lists them: with them, Radiant Boots (orange to 285) and then Radiant Leggings take you to 300 on about half the Thorium Bars, with Hearts of Fire. No plans for sale? Skip this step: the next steps go on with Derotain Mudsipper's Imperial Plate Boots, about 34 Thorium Bars a craft. Buy the boots plans whenever they turn up.
  auction 12697 x1 optional
  learn 16656 optional

step Get Heart of Fire
  when knows 16656
  tip 152 Heart of Fire for Blacksmithing 265-300: 29 Radiant Boots and 9 Radiant Leggings. Heart of Fire drops most from Entropic Beast, Scorching Elemental and Magma Elemental, among others. The arrow takes you to the best farm for your level: mobs at or below it first, then the most Heart of Fire per minute and the nearest; it picks again as you level. The guide window shows the kills and minutes it takes there and a second choice. Or buy them at the Auction House.
  collect 7077 x152 nearest gather levels 44-55
  auction 7077 x152

