step Imperial Plate Bracers to 270
  when !knows 16656
  tip Imperial Plate Bracers is yellow at 265 (yellow 265, green 275, grey 285): about 6 crafts to 270, up to 8 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 20 Thorium Bar and 1 Star Ruby. Yellow from 265, so not every craft gives a point; five more points, until the boots plans can be used at 270. Needs an anvil nearby. If you got here without learning Imperial Plate Bracers, learn it now: an earlier step teaches it.
  learn 16649 -- from the recipe in your bags
  craft 16649 until 270

step Plans: Imperial Plate Boots
  when !knows 16656
  zone Tanaris
  tip Derotain Mudsipper (Tanaris) trades Plans: Imperial Plate Boots (Blacksmithing 270) for 40 Thorium Bar in Imperial Plate Boots, which needs Blacksmithing 240 and character level 50. The plans bind when picked up.
  accept 7654
  turnin 7654

step Imperial Plate Boots to 300
  when !knows 16656
  zone Azeroth
  tip Imperial Plate Boots is orange at 270 (yellow 290, green 300, grey 310): about 34 crafts to 300, up to 37 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 34 Thorium Bar, 1 Star Ruby and 1 Aquamarine. Thirty-four Thorium Bars, a Star Ruby and an Aquamarine a craft, orange to 290: the plans you can always get past 270. Needs an anvil nearby. Blacksmithing 300 is a Legacy System milestone.
  learn 16657 -- from the recipe in your bags
  craft 16657 until 300
  skill Blacksmithing 300
